      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "42",
      "locator": "paragraph 42",
      "text": "Andrew Hairston is a civil rights attorney and writer running for Justice of the Peace in Travis County Precinct 1. A proud Black southerner, man of faith, and democratic socialist, Andrew is committed to building a justice system rooted in care, not punishment.",
      "sha256": "302636f287efcefa7b3655c4c58fa1a44d6dc7f5914444846d28d78a9af638cf"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "f9d17419d77da391b5f570ec",
      "document_id": "4d33efbbcceec3b9b2188d2b",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "43",
      "locator": "paragraph 43",
      "text": "Andrew believes our courts should serve the people with compassion, dignity, and integrity. He’s running to ensure that justice in Travis County means housing stability, community safety, and a legal system that works for everyone.",
      "sha256": "848fe5f05aecfad25c3c23771f729d88f20ce50aa18dcd8dd3fa004e6d1e91dd"
    },
    {
